=== 1. the rewriting is exact: Gamma^(q) = 1 + G(2q) + G(2-2q) ===
   max discrepancy over 12 points, 4 profiles : 3.16e-30
   and for the odd numbers G(z) = z/(2-z) gives 1/(q(1-q)) - 1, which is cor:oddsclosed:
     q = 0.30 :  series 3.7619026396   closed form 3.7619047619
     q = 0.42 :  series 3.1050903112   closed form 3.1050903120

